  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Church of Sweden Psychosocial programme 2010-2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SvK psykosocialt program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att lindra n&#xe4;d, bygga upp mots&#xe5;nd and inf&#xf6;rliva hopp  bland drabbade genom att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla att det psykosociala arbets&#xe4;ttet genomsyrar den humanit&#xe4;ra responsen inom ACT alliansen. F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade    resultat &#xe4;r att, genom kapacitetsutveckling och upplacering av        experter,SvK och dess partners n&#xe5;r ut till och st&#xf6;djer m&#xe4;nniskor som  &#xf6;verlever katastrofer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the progamme remains to alleviate suffering, rebuild      resilience and restor hope by ensuring hta the community-based        psychosocial approach is an integrated part of the humanitarian       response of ACT Alliance. The expected results are that, through      enhancing capacites and deploying psychosocial experts, the CoS and   its partners are reaching out and assisting survivors of disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
